From 569a328f07c6d3a17ae1137bd97d1cab1c0198e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sayzal28 <Sayzal28@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:27:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Open the Set step on a suggested public set and copy it
 into the project on Next

The setup generator now returns up to three public sets. The wizard keeps them in
the setup draft, opens the Set step on the first one (with the others offered as
"Or:" swaps), and copies the shown set into the project only when the author
presses Next, the same way picking it in the set list does. Going back or closing
leaves it uncopied, and a regeneration never replaces a set the author chose.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
